      "id": "claim_5e10e7b3cab9435280e815b273ea7791",
      "statement": "UUIDBase gives runtime rows a random UUID4 string primary key with ISO-8601 created_at and updated_at, while deterministic_uuid derives a stable UUID5 from a natural key so seeded rows keep the same id across machines and runs; importing the base has no DB side effects.",
